    "location": "html-block:72",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM P746"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "The MiCOM P746 centralized numerical busbar protection provides complete protection for all voltages level up to extra voltage busbar configurations.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Proven techniques, and dynamic topology processing algorithms, offer a combination of security, speed and sensitivity.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "Simple configuration for centralized architecture",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "The MiCOM P746 differential busbar protection provides a centralized one box or three boxes architecture and is very simple to use:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "It does not need to be deeply engineered and supports easy operation and maintenance of the busbar.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "Fast, secure and easy to use",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "With a typical operating time of 12 ms with High Break High Speed contact option or 17 ms with standard contacts, the P746 protection is one of the fastest in its class.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Moreover, the trips can be synchronous or sequential.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "The dynamically changing substation topology of the busbar is displayed on any PC with the substation real time dynamic monitoring tool.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "Fully communicant",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "Fully communicant with IEC61850-8.1, Courier, DNP3.0, Modbus and IEC103 protocols, the P746 is easily integrated in any substation system.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "Available in English, French, German, Spanish, Chinese & Russian",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "Contractual warranty",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Period : 2 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Fast fault trip, Synchronous or Sequential trip",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Adapted to simple busbar configurations",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "Can operate with different types of CT",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
